    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n- [x] I have updated 'mini.nvim' to latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.extra\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.11.x\n\n### Description\n\nI haven't looked too deep into this bug, but `:Pick git_hunks` is not working for me because I have `mnemonicPrefix = true` in my gitconfig. A plumbing command such as `diff-tree` may be more appropriate. Potentially `git diff-tree master -p`.\n\n- https://git-scm.com/docs/diff-config#Documentation/diff-config.txt-diffmnemonicPrefix\n- https://codeberg.org/dannyfritz/dotfiles/src/commit/f1c33a5c2690f75af9e495644ab42d307139fbd4/git/config#L28\n- [https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/6a224ddd28b4b21a488d6d87e1c2643a029caaa4/doc/mini-extra.txt#L451](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/6a224ddd28b4b21a488d6d87e1c2643a029caaa4/doc/mini-extra.txt#L451)\n- https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/79654ef/lua/mini/extra.lua#L838\n\n### Reproduction\n\nAdd this to your git config:\n```\n[diff]\n  mnemonicPrefix = true\n```\n\n1. Be in a git repository.\n2. Make some changes.\n3. Run `:Pick git_hunks`\n\n- https://git-scm.com/docs/git-config\n- https://git-scm.com/docs/diff-config#Documentation/diff-config.txt-diffmnemonicPrefix\n- https://nvim-mini.org/mini.nvim/doc/mini-extra.html#miniextra.pickers.git_hunks",
